**`app/main.py`** — Extended with 4 changes:

| # | Feature | Details |
|---|---------|---------|
| 1 | **`GET /tasks` filtering** | Optional query params `status` (TaskStatus enum), `priority` (int), `assigned_to` (str). All combinable, all optional. |
| 2 | **`GET /tasks` pagination** | `page` (default 1, ≥1) and `page_size` (default 20, ≥1). Applied after filtering. |
| 3 | **`POST /tasks`** | Requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`. Validates `project_id` exists (404 if not). Auto-generates unique ID. Returns 201. |
